{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、\nMrs.GREEN APPLEさんの\nIn the Morningを\n毎日の一曲目にきいて\n気合いをいれてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞も歌声も素敵だし\n音楽もすごい好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっとりした落ち着いた曲ばっかりきいてて、悲しい気持ちのまま過ごしてたから\n少しずつでも元気になれるように\n1日の過ごし方を工夫してるんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/21/2283571/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/21/2283571/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/21/2283571/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は短いけど。。、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠たいです、おやすみなさい。"}],"source":"archive"}